BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      One day, Elder Mara from the East village filled her vessel halfway and carried it across ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        the valley. "I trust you with this water," she said to Elder Kael of the West. As she po) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        ured it into his fountain, the water tripled before their eyes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      Kael faced a choice. He could keep all the abundant water for himself, or honor Mara's tru) Tj ET
