BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a valley. Each possessed a magic) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        al spring, but the springs were cursed: their waters only multiplied when shared with th) Tj ET
