BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    An elder reminded them: "The mist has always been here. It is not betrayal-it is the canyon') Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      s nature. Do not flee; do not hoard. Start small again.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
