BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      g confused things. But that would poison the well we've both been digging.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    "How much do we return?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    "Generously. Not just matching what they sent, but honoring the risk they took. They gave me) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (       fifteen vessels total. I return more than half-enough that they profit clearly from their) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (       faith. This teaches the canyon: 'Full trust earns full reward.'") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    The Elder's voice echoed: "The spiral climbs through reciprocal courage. When they send ever) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ything, and you return abundantly, both villages prosper more than if you'd each hoarded c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      autiously. Next round, you can both afford to give more because the returns are reliable.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    The apprentice understood: "We're not dividing a fixed amount anymore. We're growing the tot) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      al together.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    "Exactly. Each cycle of trust multiplies what we both have. The fog tried to keep us apart-b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ut now our rhythm runs deeper than any confusion. We climb because we both choose to climb) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      .") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    The highest vessels flow between those who refuse to let fear decide.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 201 of 201) Tj ET
Q
